---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { milestones, relationships, threads, terms, chapters, onThread } from '../lib/data';
import { year } from '../lib/labels';

const first = year(milestones[0]), last = year(milestones[milestones.length - 1]);
const tps = milestones.filter((m) => m.level === 'turning-point').length;
---
<Base title="NLP Lineage" description="A reference on how natural language processing led to modern language models: the milestones, the papers behind them, and what to learn first.">
  <header class="hero">
    <p class="kicker">NLP Lineage</p>
    <h1 class="title">How natural language processing led to modern language models</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A reference of <span class="count">{milestones.length}</span> milestones from {first} to {last}, and the <span class="count">{relationships.length}</span> relationships between them.
      Each milestone and each relationship links to its primary source.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/tour/">Take the guided tour</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/milestones/">Browse the milestones</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="card card-coral on-dark" aria-labelledby="h-tp">
    <h2 id="h-tp">{tps} turning points changed the most</h2>
    <p>A turning point is a milestone that many later milestones build on, across several research threads. The level is measured from the documented links, not chosen by hand.</p>
    <ul class="stats">
      <li><span class="n count">{milestones.length}</span><span class="l">milestones</span></li>
      <li><span class="n count">{relationships.length}</span><span class="l">documented relationships</span></li>
      <li><span class="n count">{threads.length}</span><span class="l">research threads</span></li>
      <li><span class="n count">{tps}</span><span class="l">turning points</span></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/levels/">See the turning points</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="h-start">
    <h2 class="h2" id="h-start">Where to start</h2>
    <ul class="tiles tiles-pastel">
      <li><a href="/tour/">Guided tour</a><p>How language models came to be: the story in {chapters.length} chapters, with working diagrams.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/milestones/">Milestones</a><p>All {milestones.length}, in date order, from {first} to {last}. Filter them by thread, kind and year.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/timeline/">Timeline</a><p>Every milestone by year, under its main thread, on one page.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/learn/">Learning path</a><p>Eight phases of study, with the milestones to understand first and short study notes.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/threads/">Threads</a><p>The {threads.length} research threads, and the milestones on each one.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/glossary/">Glossary</a><p>{terms.length ? `${terms.length} terms, each defined in plain words.` : 'Terms in plain words. The glossary is being written.'}</p></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="band card-cream card-search" aria-labelledby="h-search">
    <h2 class="h2" id="h-search">Look something up</h2>
    <form class="search-box" action="/search/" method="get" role="search">
      <label for="home-q">Search milestones, threads and terms</label>
      <div class="sb-row">
        <input id="home-q" name="q" type="search" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" />
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Search</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="h-threads">
    <h2 class="h2" id="h-threads">The threads</h2>
    <ul class="tiles">
      {threads.map((t) => (
        <li><a class="mark" style={`--c:var(--c-${t.id})`} href={`/threads/${t.id}/`}>{t.name}</a><p><span class="count">{onThread(t.id).length}</span> milestones</p></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="band card card-dark on-dark" aria-labelledby="h-learn">
    <h2 id="h-learn">Learn it in order</h2>
    <p>The learning path groups the milestones into eight phases, from the Transformer to training a model from scratch. Each phase starts with the milestones to understand first.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/learn/">Open the learning path</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="band card card-strong" aria-labelledby="h-wrong">
    <h2 id="h-wrong">Something wrong or missing?</h2>
    <p>Every page has a link at the bottom to report a problem. A link to a source that shows the correct information helps most.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/about/">How this site is made</a></div>
  </section>
</Base>
